{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"music-interval-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"music-interval-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["music-interval-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ginagamit ang Western ZXQPH0000QXZ-tone na pantay na temperament at pang-agham na notasyon ng pitch lamang. Hindi ito sinusuri ang audio, natatakpan ang mga hindi-Kanlurang sistema ng tuning o pumili ng isang enharmonic spelling para sa iyo. Tingnan ang spelling ng nota sa iyong marka.","record_id":"8af2805db598696fc8f5e1c782cbeb6d69a68c475091477b670e7847fcd96d0b","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.925610702874991,"source":"Uses Western 12-tone equal temperament and scientific pitch notation only. It does not analyze audio, cover non-Western tuning systems or choose an enharmonic spelling for you. Check the note spelling in your score.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"c239e89fa7535af1ea7a5e6a14b6acfbda3ed5b1d1a296727705e62515e1ca2d","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ginagamit ang Western 12-tone na pantay na temperament at pang-agham na notasyon ng pitch lamang. Hindi ito sinusuri ang audio, natatakpan ang mga hindi-Kanlurang sistema ng tuning o pumili ng isang enharmonic spelling para sa iyo. Tingnan ang spelling ng nota sa iyong marka.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
