{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-disability-benefit-calculator UI copy.details","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-disability-benefit-calculator.copy.details","keys":["norway-disability-benefit-calculator.copy.details"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Para sa bawat isa sa limang taon, ang tool caps pensionable kita sa ZXQPH0000QXZG. Ito averages ang tatlong pinakamataas na capped mga numero, inilalapat NAV ng ZXQPH0001QXZ rate, at pagkatapos ay inilalapat ang kapansanan degree at seguro-oras porsyento ipasok mo mula sa iyong desisyon NAV. Kung alam mo ang iyong personal na taunang minimum mula sa NAV, maaari mong ipasok ito; ang mas mataas na halaga ay ipinapakita.","record_id":"8ae1b64dc75d95bc6d1cb732fcbc4ee3d919855ad851a8586de0aed0819a46d2","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":3.28664907537501,"source":"For each of the five years, the tool caps pensionable income at 6G. It averages the three highest capped figures, applies NAV’s 66% rate, and then applies the disability degree and insurance-time percentage you enter from your NAV decision. If you know your personal annual minimum from NAV, you can enter it; the higher amount is shown.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"75ef3309131cbb6e33fffec70d28e85da112a673b582117dd6a86ef45610ec71","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Para sa bawat isa sa limang taon, ang tool caps pensionable kita sa 6G. Ito averages ang tatlong pinakamataas na capped mga numero, inilalapat NAV ng 66% rate, at pagkatapos ay inilalapat ang kapansanan degree at seguro-oras porsyento ipasok mo mula sa iyong desisyon NAV. Kung alam mo ang iyong personal na taunang minimum mula sa NAV, maaari mong ipasok ito; ang mas mataas na halaga ay ipinapakita.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"prime-factorization-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"prime-factorization-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["prime-factorization-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ibahagi sa pamamagitan ng pinakamaliit na kalakasan na hinati ang numero, pagkatapos ay ulitin ang may kuwento hanggang sa natitirang halaga ay kalakasan. Halimbawa, ZXQPH0000QXZ = ZXQPH0001QXZ³ × ZXQPH0002QXZ² × ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"8afe5b683c1782a2058c577abd3bd5221323135af1258e8165a57e8102c53240","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.979267066499915,"source":"Divide by the smallest prime that divides the number, then repeat with the quotient until the remaining value is prime. For example, 360 = 2³ × 3² × 5.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"c58af15b719d2a064d806ddf360f777bbb988534a3058830609d71ef4b8ee7d4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ibahagi sa pamamagitan ng pinakamaliit na kalakasan na hinati ang numero, pagkatapos ay ulitin ang may kuwento hanggang sa natitirang halaga ay kalakasan. Halimbawa, 360 = 2³ × 3² × 5.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"roman-numeral-converter UI copy.examples.2.text","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"roman-numeral-converter.copy.examples.2.text","keys":["roman-numeral-converter.copy.examples.2.text"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Oktubre ZXQPH0000QXZ, ZXQPH0001QXZ nagiging XXIX / X / MMXXVI sa araw / buwan / taon order. Buwan / araw / taon inilalagay X unang.","record_id":"8a8b042434aa80b6175f531f323815b31c9b85c99f2ba729d9a728c16c9ac0ca","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":0.6826149477500394,"source":"October 29, 2026 becomes XXIX / X / MMXXVI in day/month/year order. Month/day/year puts X first.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"43b90276af10110acdf6bb0a70130f9c33fc869163b226b0599d1c927efc1127","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Oktubre 29, 2026 nagiging XXIX / X / MMXXVI sa araw / buwan / taon order. Buwan / araw / taon inilalagay X unang.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
